<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MORE ROOM TO CREATE</view><view class="heading">为热爱，多留一点空间</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="balance row"><view><view class="number">{{quota.freeRemaining===null?'∞':quota.freeRemaining}}</view><view class="muted">今日剩余免费次数</view></view><view><view class="number">{{quota.credits||0}}</view><view class="muted">永久额外次数</view></view></view><view class="muted">1 元 = 1 次额外上传 · 永久有效<br/>每天优先使用免费次数，学员 1 次 / 老师 2 次 / 管理员不限。</view><view class="amount-grid"><view wx:for="{{[1,10,50]}}" wx:key="*this" class="amount {{amount===item &amp;&amp; !custom?'selected':''}}" data-amount="{{item}}" bindtap="amount"><view>¥ {{item}}</view><view class="muted">{{item}} 次上传</view></view><view class="amount"><view class="muted">自定义金额</view><input type="number" value="{{custom}}" bindinput="custom" placeholder="整数元" maxlength="5"/></view></view><view class="notice">本地模拟支付，不产生真实扣款。正式微信支付需要配置小程序与商户资质后接入。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="pay" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">模拟支付 ¥{{amount||0}}</button><view class="heading small">最近订单</view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="order"><view class="row"><text>¥{{item.yuan}} · {{item.credits}} 次</text><text class="muted">{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.state==='paid'}}">模拟支付成功</view><button wx:else class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="resume" disabled="{{busy}}">继续模拟支付</button></view><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="empty">暂无充值记录</view></view>
